{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wake up in the future to a world on the brink of extinction. Discover the source of the radiation and save civilization from a mysterious threat. Craterlands is a retro inspired 2D sandbox game with a gigantic world to explore, robust town building mechanics and a wide variety of items to craft!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A gigantic world to explore, new regions open as you advance the story and you can even travel to different planets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic day/night cycle. Different enemies may come out at night and even the seasons change in some regions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RPG Leveling System - Level up as you explore, fight mutants and complete quests. Tailor your build by spending skill points and specialize in melee, ranged, energy or minions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 4 Person Multiplayer - Have your friends join to build, explore and fight a variety of epic bosses.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intricate Electrical Systems. Wire up lights, machines and other gadgets. Control lighting and electrical signals through network controls<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/GroundSeal_Wiring.gif?t=1752939594\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automation - Link machines together with tubes and conveyer belts to create advanced recipes<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/GroundSeal_Automation.gif?t=1752939594\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NPC Classes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Rescue NPCs and add them to your towns. Add buildings and assign them roles such as Blacksmith, Hospital, Forester and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/GroundSeal_Blacksmith.gif?t=1752939594\" /></div>\u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/GroundSeal_Forester.gif?t=1752939594\" /></div>\u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/GroundSeal_Scientist.gif?t=1752939594\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover alien races and build unique settlements on other planets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/GroundSeal_Robots.gif?t=1752939594\" /></div>\u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/GroundSeal_Lunite.gif?t=1752939594\" /></div>\u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/extras/GroundSeal_Xythian.gif?t=1752939594\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3175290?t=1752939594","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/2c1eca8955bfc71b9d0353068858dff74a5e07ee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752939594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/2c150ac3413b3b4d32fd8f8b895755596b9b80f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752939594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175290/2c150ac3413b3b4d32fd8f8b895755596b9b80f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752939594","categories":[{"description":"Single